        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8531RATR, R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Square Quincy Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Quincy Rose is from Emtek's Select Collection where in you can design your own style door lever. The R-Bar  stem has a curve to it that leans the style more towards traditional. When paired with the Faceted Tribeca Handle, this leverset is truly stunning--a transitional work of art. The R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Square Quincy Rosette is available in a multitude of modern finish colors. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-RA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354617\" width=\"600\" height=\"163\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek R-Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the R-Bar Tribeca Door Lever with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Faceted Tribeca Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-RA-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262419\"><b>Emtek Select R-Bar Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Quincy Rose",
                "description": "The R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Quincy Rose is from Emtek's Select Collection where in you can design your own style door lever. The R-Bar  stem has a curve to it that leans the style more towards traditional. When paired with the Faceted Tribeca Handle, this leverset is truly stunning--a transitional work of art. The R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Square Quincy Rosette is available in a multitude of modern finish colors. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "R-Bar Tribeca Door Lever with Quincy Roses, Emtek 8531RATR dummy levers,  Emtek 8131RATR passage levers, Emtek 8261RATR privacy levers, R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Square Quincy Rosettes, R-Bar Tribeca Lever with Quincy Roses, Tribeca Lever R-Bar with Quincy Roses, EMT-8531RATR,  Faceted Tribeca Leverset with Square Roses,"
            },
